
# AWS Subnets

## Overview

A subnet is a logical subdivision of an AWS VPC IP address range.

## Types

### Public Subnet

Resources can have a route to the internet through an Internet Gateway.

### Private Subnet

Resources do not have a direct route to the Internet Gateway.

## Example

```text
VPC: 10.0.0.0/16

Public Subnet:
10.0.1.0/24

Private Subnet:
10.0.2.0/24
